<title>USA: TABLE - Walgreen Co Q3 May 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Walgreen Co Q3 May 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited:  in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>					   QUARTER ENDED</p>
<p>				   May 31	    May 31    Percent</p>
<p>				     1997	     1996	Change</p>
<p> Net sales		  $3,403,281     $2,988,836	13.9%</p>
<p> Net earnings		  108,101	   91,575	18.0%</p>
<p>Net earnings</p>
<p>   per share(A)		    .44		.37	18.9%</p>
<p>Dividends declared</p>
<p>   per share			 .12		.11	 9.1%</p>
<p>					  NINE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>				    May 31	    May 31    Percent</p>
<p>					 1997	    1996	Change</p>
<p> Net sales		  $10,059,880     $8,860,692	13.5%</p>
<p> Net earnings		   330,560	  282,031	17.2%</p>
<p>Net earnings</p>
<p>   per share(A)		    1.33	     1.14	16.7%</p>
<p>Dividends declared</p>
<p>   per share			  .36		.33	 9.1%</p>
<p>(A) -- The weighted average number of common shares and equivalents used for calculating primary net earnings per share was 248,962,000 and 248,388,000 for the nine months ended May 31, 1997 and 1996, respectively.  Fully diluted net earnings per share are the same as primary net earnings per share.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
